# CI install for the audio analyzer.
#
# These are the direct dependencies from client/requirements.txt and
# server/requirements.txt. torch and torchaudio are omitted on purpose:
# server/handler.py does not import them, the RunPod PyTorch base image
# already supplies CUDA builds, and CPU wheels would make this job slow.
#
# Regenerate requirements/ci.lock with:
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes -o requirements/ci.lock requirements/ci.in

